We didn't celebrate your birthday, Harry.

432
00:40:10,380 --> 00:40:13,230
Ginny and I, we prepared a cake.

433
00:40:13,230 --> 00:40:15,220
We were going to bring it out at the end of the wedding.

434
00:40:15,270 --> 00:40:16,400
Hermione, honestly,

435
00:40:16,950 --> 00:40:18,230
I appreciate the thought,

436
00:40:18,290 --> 00:40:20,150
but really given the fact, that we were almost killed

437
00:40:20,170 --> 00:40:22,090
by a couple of Death Eaters a few minutes ago.

438
00:40:24,710 --> 00:40:28,310
Right... perspective.

439
00:40:28,350 --> 00:40:30,080
We have to get off the streets, get to someplace safe.

440
00:41:04,290 --> 00:41:05,940
What was that all about?

441
00:41:07,370 --> 00:41:09,960
Probably Mad-Eye's idea.

442
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:12,270
In case Snape decides to come snooping.

443
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:23,060
Homenum Revelio.

444
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:31,250
