Lovely.

451
00:43:22,670 --> 00:43:25,490
Regulus Arcturus Black

452
00:43:26,290 --> 00:43:27,460
R.A.B.

453
00:43:31,590 --> 00:43:34,380
"I know I will be dead long before you read this. "

454
00:43:35,090 --> 00:43:38,450
"I have stolen the real horcrux and intend to destroy it. "

455
00:43:39,520 --> 00:43:41,220
R.A.B, he was Sirius' brother?

456
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:43,040
Yes.

457
